  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Program to Mitigate the Economic Effects of the Coronavirus - BRDE (Emergency PROSUL)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Emergencia para la Mitigacin de los Efectos Econmicos del Coronavirus - BRDE (PROSUL Emergencial)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es apoyar la sostenibilidad frente a la crisis del COVID-19, de las MIPYME como sostn del empleo en los Estados de la Regin Sur de Brasil. El objetivo especfico es apoyar la sostenibilidad financiera de corto plazo de las MIPYME localizadas en la Regin Sur de Brasil.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of this project is to support Micro, Small and Medium Entreprises (MSME) sustainability against the COVID-19 crisis as well as employment level support in the states of Brazil South Region. The specific goal is to support financial sustainability in the short term for MSME located in the South Region of Brazil.</narrative>
  </description>
